  "title": "Cakes - Flossed Up",
  "htmlContent": "&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-123638 aligncenter\" src=\"http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/artworks-000284135870-737m4d-t500x500-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\n\n&nbsp;\n\nCakes are more than just your typical female artist with an alluring feel. She’s notably one of the most versatile rappers/songstress coming from Virginia, in a manner that is delivering a hint of fresh air to many genres in the music scene. Her rebel style can be heard through her songs such as “Who Gon Check Me,” “Sauce,” and her reputable party anthem, “My Section.” Throughout her music, Cakes conveys her struggles with raising up as a woman consumed in a man’s world; in turn, giving strength and encouragement to women worldwide.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nBeing 'flossed up' is beyond the glitz and glamor. It's a lifestyle and a mindset that finds out your legacy: the ultimate measure of your true shine. Boss babe Cakes are starting the year off right dropping her new banker \"Flossed Up,\" inspiring you never to give up and never to let anyone steal your trust. When life draws you down, remember that diamonds are made under the weight of mountains. If one of your New Year's resolutions is to watch over your dreams and shine in spite of non-believers, then 'Flossed Up' may be your anthem for 2018.\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Find more info on Cakes here:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id=2612384.20471.1.e9b2a9fc543f8450a71175feffd2ff00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id%3D2612384.20471.1.e9b2a9fc543f8450a71175feffd2ff00&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516140573068000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEXD4rC5udFmGlxp0j2J7-jYf2wUg\">Itscakess.com</a>\n<a href=\"http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id=2612384.20472.1.8563b89619cb5edf6f81316c7d3bd774\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id%3D2612384.20472.1.8563b89619cb5edf6f81316c7d3bd774&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516140573068000&amp;usg=AFQjCNH2YAhQLFf3UCnR0J5TK92n329J6w\">Facebook</a>\n<a href=\"http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id=2612384.20473.1.13922d1fac1c56ce0798cf6ec1bdbbfd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id%3D2612384.20473.1.13922d1fac1c56ce0798cf6ec1bdbbfd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516140573068000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGrvwNYEvhkNCpZBJywnQa0OblrmA\">Twitter</a>\n<a href=\"http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id=2612384.20474.1.7c21e950b787f406344a9ae1f5322ed9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id%3D2612384.20474.1.7c21e950b787f406344a9ae1f5322ed9&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516140573068000&amp;usg=AFQjCNF4ujnjPRmKl7evHdEeixTnqMv9CQ\">Soundcloud</a>\n<a href=\"http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id=2612384.20475.1.1f633024f8d6cc5bb788c5133530943c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://sable.madmimi.com/c/16853?id%3D2612384.20475.1.1f633024f8d6cc5bb788c5133530943c&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516140573068000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGqNVYMsEsnHQRZ0kpNfnsaKSt94Q\">Instagram</a></p>\n<iframe src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/382545785&amp;color=%23ff5500&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;show_comments=true&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false&amp;show_teaser=true&amp;visual=true\" width=\"100%\" height=\"300\" frameborder=\"no\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe>",
